        a                              ecrm:E8_Acquisition ;
        rdfs:comment                   "1880 Register entry: Dress piece (Sari). Cotton. Woven with a check pattern of spots in white on a purple ground with narrow side borders in black, white and yellow. The principle end border has transverse bands and stripes in orange silk and white cottton. Madura. 19th cent. L.23 ft. 9 in, W. 3 ft 6 in. Bought 8s 6d"@en ;
